7. Public Opinion and Trends
The analysis of Amazon customer reviews provides valuable insights into customer satisfaction and market trends.

Positive reviews indicate customer satisfaction with product quality and value.

Negative reviews highlight issues such as poor quality, damaged products, or delayed delivery.

Neutral reviews represent factual opinions without strong emotions.

Businesses can use these insights to:

Improve product quality.
Enhance customer experience.
Identify common customer complaints.
Support marketing strategies.
Improve brand reputation.

8. Conclusion
This project demonstrates how Natural Language Processing can be used to analyze customer reviews and understand public opinion. The generated visualizations make it easy to identify customer sentiment patterns and support better business decisions.

